    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:arny_teror_dialog_phrase_1#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 2998,
      "string_id": "arny_teror_dialog_phrase_1",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Arnie, I'm here on business. What can you tell me about that spooky note?",
      "JA_current": "アーニー、仕事で来た。あの不気味な脅迫状について何か知っていることはないか？",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "arny_teror_dialog",
          "phrase_id": "0",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:arny_teror_dialog_phrase_2#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 3001,
      "string_id": "arny_teror_dialog_phrase_2",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "The one from three days ago? Yeah, it wasn't just me that got it, Barkeep and Voronin also got one each.",
      "JA_current": "3日前に届いたやつのことか？ ああ、受け取ったのは俺だけじゃない。バーキープとヴォロニン将軍のところにも1通ずつ届いてる。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "arny_teror_dialog",
          "phrase_id": "1",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:arny_teror_dialog_phrase_3#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 3004,
      "string_id": "arny_teror_dialog_phrase_3",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Who do you think it could be?",
      "JA_current": "誰の仕業だと思う？",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "arny_teror_dialog",
          "phrase_id": "2",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:arny_teror_dialog_phrase_4#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 3007,
      "string_id": "arny_teror_dialog_phrase_4",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "If I'd known, I wouldn't have sat around with idle hands. Sure, I've made some enemies, but this lunatic wants to blow up the whole Bar to hell! Personally, I think this is the work of the monolith group, those psychos from up North who defend the center!",
      "JA_current": "見当がついてりゃ、こうして手をこまねいて座っちゃいねえよ。そりゃ俺だって恨みを買う覚えくらいあるが、このイカレ野郎はロストクのバー全体を吹き飛ばす気だぞ！ 個人的にはモノリスの仕業じゃねえかと思ってる。北の中心部を死守してる、あの狂信者どもさ！",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "arny_teror_dialog",
          "phrase_id": "3",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:arny_teror_dialog_phrase_5#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 3010,
      "string_id": "arny_teror_dialog_phrase_5",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Why do you think the terrorist sent notes to you, the bartender, and the general?",
      "JA_current": "なぜ犯人は、あんたとバーキープ、それに将軍の3人に手紙を送りつけてきたんだと思う？",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "arny_teror_dialog",
          "phrase_id": "4",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:arny_teror_dialog_phrase_6#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 3013,
      "string_id": "arny_teror_dialog_phrase_6",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Well, because we are the most influential people here, we hold the most authority! Why?",
      "JA_current": "そりゃ、俺たちがこの界隈で一番顔が利いて、絶大な影響力を持ってるからに決まってんだろ！ それがどうしたってんだ？",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "arny_teror_dialog",
          "phrase_id": "5",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:arny_teror_dialog_phrase_7#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 3016,
      "string_id": "arny_teror_dialog_phrase_7",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Did you have any common business affairs with the other two?",
      "JA_current": "他の2人と何か裏で共同の商売でもやってたんじゃないのか？",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "arny_teror_dialog",
          "phrase_id": "6",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:arny_teror_dialog_phrase_8#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 3019,
      "string_id": "arny_teror_dialog_phrase_8",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "I don't understand, are you looking for this terrorist or are you trying to stick your nose into my business?",
      "JA_current": "おいおい、訳が分からねえな。お前はテロリストを探してるのか、それとも俺の商売を詮索しに来たのか、どっちなんだ？",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "arny_teror_dialog",
          "phrase_id": "7",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
